 System operators do have the right to review/scan Email for improper
content etc. They need not necessarily  interfere with it but may if
there is cause such as use for illegal drug deals, solicitation etc
etc. But mail may be reviewed for content. With over 130+ conferences ,
mail is spot checked routinely.

On a bbs users ARE notified mail may be reviewed. It is stated in the
operational policy statements which they agree to upon registering.

